I added `expiringSoon` at the end of `src/pumpout.ts`. It sums `left` over batches that are spendable on `day` (bought on or before it, and less than `TOKEN_LIFE_DAYS` old) but dead on `day + within`. It returns 0 when `within` is 0 or negative and does not modify the wallet.

I wrote the date checks inline instead of calling `isLive`, because I couldn't see its body and didn't want to assume it matches your rules. I also haven't seen the end of the file, so I'm assuming appending there is safe.
